    {
      "title": "How it works",
      "text": "Vyo reads your project and draws its parts as a picture. It checks every word around the picture, then writes a PNG and a PDF."
    },
    {
      "title": "What stays out",
      "text": "Jargon, file paths and text that runs into the picture fail the check. Vyo names what to fix, and the check keeps failing until nothing is caught."
    },
    {
      "title": "Counted for you",
      "text": "You write the headline and the notes. Vyo writes every count itself from your code, so no number on the poster is typed by hand."
